{#-
  Per-case `src/main.rs` driver for the runtime conformance sweep.

  Hand port of the upstream runtime-testsuite helper template
  `helpers/src/main.rs.stg`. Attribute defaults mirror upstream
  `RuntimeTests.test` and `RuntimeRunner.writeRecognizerFile`:

  - Parser tests import `<G>Lexer`, `<G>Parser`, the listener, and the visitor.
  - Prediction mode is `LL` unless a descriptor flag overrides it.
  - Parse trees are on unless `notBuildParseTree` is set.

  Context: `grammar_name`, `lexer_name`, `lexer_mod`, `grammar_mod`,
  `parser_name` and `parser_mod` (parser tests only), `start_rule`,
  `prediction_mode`, `show_diagnostic_errors`, `build_parse_tree`, `show_dfa`.
-#}
